    "updated_at": "2025-11-20T17:01:17Z",
    "body": "There is no semantic element for arbitrary addresses. The `address` element specifically represents contact information.\n\nI think the specification contains examples for all of these, though not all of them are directly placed in the paragraphs section. Searching for `<p` yields quite a few.",
