    "updated_at": "2025-11-20T17:30:46Z",
    "body": "What do you mean by \"arbitrary addresses\"? Can you provide examples of using an address, where it is better as a `p` than an `address` (or `div`, for that matter)? I'm not being pedantic here. I'm trying to understand. Thanks!",
