    "updated_at": "2025-11-20T17:42:31Z",
    "body": "Doesn't how you present that address in your blog significantly factor into how it is coded?\n\nIn prose, it is just part of the sentence/paragraph.\n\n> The Tokyo post office at 123 First Street in Nishishinjuku is easy to miss.\n\nBut if you break it out as an address, wouldn't it make sense as `address`?\n\n> If you are looking for a place to post a letter, the post office's address is:\n> 123 First Street\n> Nishishinjuku\n> Shinjuku City\n> Tokyo 160-0023, Japan\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/3559261319/reactions",
