    "updated_at": "2025-11-21T06:01:07Z",
    "body": "If it was in a `div` element it would still end up counting as a paragraph, due to implicit paragraphs. I forgot the rationale around most of this, but I remember it was discussed back in the day. Your best bet would be going through https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/.",
